msgid "Generate SqDRIFT circuits {#generate-sqdrift-circuits}"
msgstr "Jana litar SqDRIFT {#generate-sqdrift-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With sample-based quantum diagonalization ([SQD](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068)), you must choose an ansatz from which to sample bitstrings. The [SqDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.02578) variant uses an ensemble of time evolution circuits constructed directly from the target Hamiltonian instead. This is achieved by subsampling smaller time evolution operators from the Hamiltonian based on its coefficients, which is known as the [qDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.08017) Trotterization method.\n"
msgstr "Dengan pepenjuruan kuantum berasaskan sampel ([SQD](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068)), anda mesti memilih ansatz untuk mensampel rentetan bit. Varian [SqDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.02578) sebaliknya menggunakan ensembel litar evolusi masa yang dibina terus daripada Hamiltonian sasaran. Ini dicapai dengan mensubsampel operator evolusi masa yang lebih kecil daripada Hamiltonian berdasarkan pekalinya, yang dikenali sebagai kaedah Trotterisasi [qDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.08017).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This getting started guide shows how to generate an ensemble of such randomized circuits.\n"
msgstr "Panduan permulaan ini menunjukkan cara menjana ensembel litar rawak sedemikian.\n"

